name: ud-italian-markit
tier: default
url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_Italian-MarkIT/r2.16/it_markit-ud-train.conllu
sha256: 4f6fc3423acb00d49e1e167bd21b11ebbc23e22275fd6f5eeb4d75cfbbccc5c6
license-url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_Italian-MarkIT/r2.16/LICENSE.txt
license: CC BY 4.0
note: The recipes train POS and lemma models on this treebank, gated against OpenNLP's Italian UD models, which are local-only and only scored; the data itself is permissive.
note: The text has a space between almost every two tokens (9 SpaceAfter=No in the whole treebank), so it has no sentence or token recipe, as docs/licences.md records.
note: Attribution: Paccosi, Palmero Aprosio and Tonelli, It is MarkIT That is New, CLIC-it 2021.
